"ស្ថានភាពការបញ្ជាទិញត្រូវបានកំណត់ដោយ %s; មិនមានការទូទាត់ប្រាក់នៅកន្លែងគិតលុយទេ។"

#. translators: %s is the number of orders with POS - Open status.
#: includes/Orders.php:1224
#, php-format
msgid "POS - Open <span class=\"count\">(%s)</span>"
msgid_plural "POS - Open <span class=\"count\">(%s)</span>"
msgstr[0] "POS - បើក <span class=\"count\">(%s)</span>"

#. translators: %s is the number of orders with POS - Partial Payment status.
#: includes/Orders.php:1242
#, php-format
msgid "POS - Partial Payment <span class=\"count\">(%s)</span>"
msgid_plural "POS - Partial Payment <span class=\"count\">(%s)</span>"
msgstr[0] "POS - ទូទាត់មួយផ្នែក <span class=\"count\">(%s)</span>"

#: includes/Payments/Contract/Abstract_Capture_Mode_Handler.php:91
msgid "This payment capture mode does not support that operation."
msgstr "របៀបទទួលការបង់ប្រាក់នេះមិនគាំទ្រប្រតិបត្តិការនោះទេ។"

#. translators: 1: attempt id, 2: payment method title.
#: includes/Payments/Contract/Attempts.php:317
#, php-format
msgid ""
"WCPOS payment attempt %1$s: the outcome is unknown and %2$s cannot say whether money was taken. Check the payment with the provider, then cancel the attempt at the POS if nothing was charged."
msgstr ""
"ការព្យាយាមទូទាត់ WCPOS %1$s៖ មិនដឹងលទ្ធផលទេ ហើយ %2$s មិនអាចបញ្ជាក់ថាបានដកប្រាក់ឬអត់។ សូមពិនិត្យការទូទាត់ជាមួយអ្នកផ្តល់សេវា បន្ទាប់មកបោះបង់ការព្យាយាមនៅ POS ប្រសិនបើមិនមានការគិតប្រាក់ទេ។"

#: includes/Payments/Contract/Attempts.php:406
msgid "Clearing the awaiting-customer state"
msgstr "កំពុងសម្អាតស្ថានភាពរង់ចាំអតិថិជន"

#: includes/Payments/Contract/Command_Log.php:105
msgid "This command ID was already used with a different request."
msgstr "ID ពាក្យបញ្ជានេះត្រូវបានប្រើរួចហើយជាមួយសំណើផ្សេង។"

#: includes/Payments/Contract/Command_Log.php:241
#: includes/Payments/Contract/Gateway_Submission.php:108
msgid "This attempt was cancelled or superseded at the till."
msgstr "ការប៉ុនប៉ងនេះត្រូវបានបោះបង់ ឬជំនួសនៅកន្លែងគិតប្រាក់។"

#: includes/Payments/Contract/Command_Log.php:267
msgid "The order changed since this command was built; read it again."
msgstr ""
"ការបញ្ជាទិញបានផ្លាស់ប្តូរចាប់តាំងពីពាក្យបញ្ជានេះត្រូវបានបង្កើត។ សូមអានវាម្តងទៀត។"

#: includes/Payments/Contract/Completion_Stamp.php:94
msgid "Recording the completion"
msgstr "កំពុងកត់ត្រាការបញ្ចប់"

#. translators: %d: completion number.
#: includes/Payments/Contract/Completion_Stamp.php:148
#, php-format
msgid "WCPOS: completion %d could not be recorded; reconcile manually."
msgstr "WCPOS៖ មិនអាចកត់ត្រាការបញ្ចប់ %d បានទេ។ សូមផ្ទៀងផ្ទាត់ឡើងវិញដោយដៃ។"

#: includes/Payments/Contract/Completion_Stamp.php:183
#: includes/Payments/Contract/Completion_Stamp.php:205
msgid ""
"WCPOS: the reopen could not be recorded on the completion history; reconcile manually."
msgstr ""
"WCPOS៖ មិនអាចកត់ត្រាការបើកឡើងវិញក្នុងប្រវត្តិការបញ្ចប់បានទេ។ សូមផ្ទៀងផ្ទាត់ឡើងវិញដោយដៃ។"

#: includes/Payments/Contract/Gateway_Handler.php:73
msgid "The payment provider did not refund this payment."
msgstr "អ្នកផ្តល់សេវាទូទាត់មិនបានសងប្រាក់វិញសម្រាប់ការទូទាត់នេះទេ។"

#: includes/Payments/Contract/Gateway_Handler.php:115
msgid "The order was paid before this payment attempt was sent."
msgstr "បានបង់ថ្លៃការបញ្ជាទិញរួចហើយ មុនពេលផ្ញើការព្យាយាមទូទាត់នេះ។"

#: includes/Payments/Contract/Gateway_Handler.php:144
msgid "This payment cannot be voided."
msgstr "មិនអាចលុបចោលការបង់ប្រាក់នេះបានទេ។"

#: includes/Payments/Contract/Gateway_Submission.php:54
msgid "Attempt ID must be a UUID."
msgstr "ID ការប៉ុនប៉ងត្រូវតែជា UUID។"

#: includes/Payments/Contract/Gateway_Submission.php:57
msgid "Only POS orders take a gateway submission."
msgstr "មានតែការបញ្ជាទិញ POS ប៉ុណ្ណោះដែលអាចដាក់សំណើទៅ gateway។"

#: includes/Payments/Contract/Gateway_Submission.php:79
msgid "An earlier payment attempt on this order has no outcome yet."
msgstr "ការព្យាយាមទូទាត់មុននេះសម្រាប់ការបញ្ជាទិញនេះ មិនទាន់មានលទ្ធផលទេ។"

#: includes/Payments/Contract/Gateway_Submission.php:113
msgid "Payment method is not enabled for the POS."
msgstr "វិធីទូទាត់នេះមិនត្រូវបានបើកប្រើសម្រាប់ POS ទេ។"

#: includes/Payments/Contract/Gateway_Submission.php:121
msgid "Order is already paid."
msgstr "ការបញ្ជាទិញបានបង់ប្រាក់រួចហើយ។"

#: includes/Payments/Contract/Gateway_Submission.php:125
msgid "Order already has a live payment."
msgstr "ការបញ្ជាទិញនេះមានការទូទាត់សកម្មរួចហើយ។"

#: includes/Payments/Contract/Gateway_Submission.php:206
msgid "The payment method rejected the details entered."
msgstr "វិធីទូទាត់បានបដិសេធព័ត៌មានលម្អិតដែលបានបញ្ចូល។"

#. translators: 1: attempt id, 2: payment method title.
#: includes/Payments/Contract/Gateway_Submission.php:294
#, php-format
msgid ""
"WCPOS payment attempt %1$s: %2$s failed after the payment was sent. Check with the provider whether money was taken, then cancel the attempt at the POS."
msgstr ""
"ការព្យាយាមទូទាត់ប្រាក់ %1$s របស់ WCPOS៖ %2$s បានបរាជ័យ បន្ទាប់ពីបានផ្ញើការទូទាត់។ សូមពិនិត្យជាមួយអ្នកផ្តល់សេវាថាតើប្រាក់ត្រូវបានដកឬអត់ បន្ទាប់មកបោះបង់ការព្យាយាមនៅ POS។"

#: includes/Payments/Contract/Gateway_Submission.php:298
#: includes/Payments/Contract/Gateway_Submission.php:313
msgid "The payment provider failed."
msgstr "អ្នកផ្តល់សេវាទូទាត់មានបញ្ហា។"

#. translators: %s: the host the gateway wanted to redirect the browser to.
#: includes/Payments/Contract/Gateway_Submission.php:317
#, php-format
msgid ""
"This payment method wants to open %s in a browser, which the POS cannot follow."
msgstr ""
"វិធីទូទាត់នេះចង់បើក %s ក្នុងកម្មវិធីរុករក ប៉ុន្តែ POS មិនអាចបន្តបានទេ។"

#. translators: 1: the gateway's verb label (e.g. "Send invoice"), 2: the order status the merchant stored for this gateway.
#: includes/Payments/Contract/Gateway_Submission.php:378
#, php-format
msgid "Settled via POS: %1$s on %2$s"
msgstr "បានបញ្ចប់ការលក់តាម POS៖ %1$s ជាមួយស្ថានភាពការបញ្ជាទិញ %2$s"

#. translators: 1: the gateway's verb label (e.g. "Send invoice"), 2: the destination the cashier entered.
#: includes/Payments/Contract/Gateway_Submission.php:394
#, php-format
msgid "Sent via POS: %1$s (%2$s)"
msgstr "បានផ្ញើតាម POS៖ %1$s (%2$s)"

#. translators: 1: attempt id, 2: payment method title.
#: includes/Payments/Contract/Gateway_Submission.php:417
#, php-format
msgid ""
"WCPOS payment attempt %1$s: %2$s answered, but the POS could not record it. Check the order with the provider, then cancel the attempt at the POS."
msgstr ""
"ការព្យាយាមទូទាត់ប្រាក់ WCPOS %1$s៖ %2$s បានឆ្លើយតប ប៉ុន្តែ POS មិនអាចកត់ត្រាវាបានទេ។ សូមពិនិត្យការបញ្ជាទិញជាមួយអ្នកផ្តល់សេវា រួចបោះបង់ការព្យាយាមនេះនៅ POS។"

#. translators: %s: attempt id.
#: includes/Payments/Contract/Gateway_Submission.php:446
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Payment attempt %s may already have been paid by the gateway; reconcile the payment before cancelling it."
msgstr ""
"ការព្យាយាមទូទាត់ប្រាក់ %s ប្រហែលជាត្រូវបានបង់រួចហើយតាមរយៈច្រកទូទាត់។ សូមផ្ទៀងផ្ទាត់ការទូទាត់មុនពេលបោះបង់វា។"

#: includes/Payments/Contract/Gateway_Submission.php:454
msgid "This invoice cannot be cancelled."
msgstr "មិនអាចបោះបង់វិក្កយបត្រនេះបានទេ។"

#: includes/Payments/Contract/Gateway_Submission.php:457
msgid "The invoice was sent by a different payment method."
msgstr "វិក្កយបត្រនេះត្រូវបានផ្ញើតាមវិធីទូទាត់ផ្សេង។"

#: includes/Payments/Contract/Gateway_Submission.php:461
msgid "A newer invoice has been sent for this order."
msgstr "វិក្កយបត្រថ្មីជាងនេះត្រូវបានផ្ញើសម្រាប់ការបញ្ជាទិញនេះ។"

#. translators: 1: the payment method title, 2: the cashier's reason.
#: includes/Payments/Contract/Gateway_Submission.php:467
#, php-format
msgid "Cancelled via POS: %1$s. %2$s"
msgstr "បានបោះបង់តាម POS៖ %1$s។ %2$s"

#. translators: 1: attempt id, 2: the staff member's display name, 3: the cashier's reason.
#: includes/Payments/Contract/Gateway_Submission.php:501
#, php-format
msgid ""
"WCPOS payment attempt %1$s closed at the POS by %2$s: nothing more was charged, and the sale's payments already cover it. %3$s"
msgstr ""
"%2$s បានបិទការព្យាយាមទូទាត់ WCPOS %1$s នៅ POS៖ មិនមានការគិតប្រាក់បន្ថែមទេ ហើយការទូទាត់សម្រាប់ការលក់បានគ្រប់ចំនួនរួចហើយ។ %3$s"

#. translators: 1: attempt id, 2: the staff member's display name, 3: the cashier's reason.
#: includes/Payments/Contract/Gateway_Submission.php:501
msgid "an unknown user"
msgstr "អ្នកប្រើមិនស្គាល់"

#: includes/Payments/Contract/Gateway_Submission.php:626
msgid "This field must be true or false."
msgstr "វាលនេះត្រូវតែជា true ឬ false។"

#: includes/Payments/Contract/Gateway_Submission.php:631
msgid "This field must be text."
msgstr "វាលនេះត្រូវតែជាអត្ថបទ។"

#: includes/Payments/Contract/Gateway_Submission.php:635
msgid "This field is required."
msgstr "ត្រូវបំពេញវាលនេះ។"

#: includes/Payments/Contract/Gateway_Submission.php:639
msgid "Choose one of the listed options."
msgstr "ជ្រើសរើសជម្រើសមួយក្នុងចំណោមជម្រើសដែលបានរាយ។"

#: includes/Payments/Contract/Gateway_Submission.php:653
msgid "Check the payment fields."
msgstr "សូមពិនិត្យវាលទូទាត់។"

#: includes/Payments/Contract/Ledger.php:580
msgid ""
"This payment method cannot be recorded; it has to run its own payment leg."
msgstr ""
"មិនអាចកត់ត្រាមធ្យោបាយបង់ប្រាក់នេះដោយផ្ទាល់បានទេ។ វាត្រូវដំណើរការផ្នែកបង់ប្រាក់របស់ខ្លួន។"

#: includes/Payments/Contract/Ledger.php:586
msgid "Recorded payments must be captured or authorized."
msgstr "ការបង់ប្រាក់ដែលបានកត់ត្រាត្រូវតែបានទទួល ឬបានអនុញ្ញាត។"

#: includes/Payments/Contract/Ledger.php:594
#: includes/Payments/Contract/Ledger.php:598
msgid "Tendered amount is invalid for this payment method."
msgstr "ចំនួនប្រាក់ដែលទទួលមិនត្រឹមត្រូវសម្រាប់មធ្យោបាយបង់ប្រាក់នេះ។"

#: includes/Payments/Contract/Ledger.php:815
msgid "Payment method is disabled."
msgstr "មធ្យោបាយបង់ប្រាក់ត្រូវបានបិទ។"

#: includes/Payments/Contract/Ledger.php:823
#: includes/Payments/Contract/Ledger.php:1685
#: includes/Payments/Contract/Ledger.php:1746
msgid "The order is already paid."
msgstr "ការបញ្ជាទិញនេះបានបង់ប្រាក់រួចហើយ។"

#: includes/Payments/Contract/Ledger.php:823
#: includes/Payments/Contract/Ledger.php:1686
msgid "Payment amount exceeds the order balance."
msgstr "ចំនួនប្រាក់បង់លើសសមតុល្យនៅសល់នៃការបញ្ជាទិញ។"

#: includes/Payments/Contract/Ledger.php:835
#: includes/Payments/Contract/Ledger.php:1688
#: includes/Payments/Contract/Ledger.php:1861
msgid "Another payment is already in progress on this order."
msgstr "ការទូទាត់ផ្សេងទៀតកំពុងដំណើរការលើការបញ្ជាទិញនេះរួចហើយ។"

#: includes/Payments/Contract/Ledger.php:1078
msgid "Tip"
msgstr "ប្រាក់ធីប"

#. translators: 1: payment ID, 2: expected amount/currency, 3: confirmed amount/currency.
#: includes/Payments/Contract/Ledger.php:1134
#, php-format
msgid "WCPOS payment %1$s amount mismatch: expected %2$s, confirmed %3$s."
msgstr ""
"ចំនួនប្រាក់បង់ WCPOS %1$s មិនត្រូវគ្នា៖ រំពឹង %2$s ប៉ុន្តែបញ្ជាក់ %3$s។"

#: includes/Payments/Contract/Ledger.php:1226
msgid "Refund must belong to this order."
msgstr "ការសងប្រាក់វិញត្រូវតែជារបស់ការបញ្ជាទិញនេះ។"

#: includes/Payments/Contract/Ledger.php:1229
#: includes/Payments/Contract/Ledger.php:1244
#: includes/Payments/Contract/Ledger.php:1299
msgid "Refund amount cannot be allocated to this payment."
msgstr "មិនអាចបែងចែកចំនួនប្រាក់សងវិញទៅការបង់ប្រាក់នេះបានទេ។"

#: includes/Payments/Contract/Ledger.php:1262
msgid "The refund could not be reserved; retry."
msgstr "មិនអាចរក្សាទុកការសងប្រាក់វិញបានទេ។ សូមព្យាយាមម្ដងទៀត។"

#. translators: 1: refund ID, 2: amount with currency, 3: payment method ID
#: includes/Payments/Contract/Ledger.php:1359
#, php-format
msgid ""
"WCPOS: refund #%1$d for %2$s was sent to %3$s; confirm it with the provider before retrying."
msgstr ""
